Person: Write a JavaScript function to reverse a string.
AI: function reverseString(s) { return s.split('').reverse().join(''); }
Person: Convert it to an arrow function.
AI: const reverseString = s => s.split('').reverse().join('');

Person: Write a SQL query that returns the count of orders per customer from a table named orders with column customer_id.
AI: SELECT customer_id, COUNT(*) AS order_count FROM orders GROUP BY customer_id;
Person: Add a filter to return only customers with more than 5 orders.
AI: SELECT customer_id, COUNT(*) AS order_count FROM orders GROUP BY customer_id HAVING COUNT(*) > 5;
